<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">An engineer can design the change and wants practice leading the review. Another private coaching session would leave the opportunity unchanged. Find the forum where they can take responsibility and agree on the support they want.</p>

<!-- @before The Mentorship Contract :: staff -->
### Agree on the next chance to practise

Pick one piece of work the engineer can own, such as presenting two alternatives at a design review. Agree on preparation, observation and feedback. Sponsorship can make the opportunity available. Mentorship can help the engineer use it. [What sponsorship looks like](https://larahogan.me/blog/what-sponsorship-looks-like/).
